  "text": "### 6. Fraud & AML Performance  \n**Summary:**\nHead of Financial Crime presented Q4 2025 fraud and AML metrics.  \n**Fraud Metrics:**\n- Fraud incidents: 5 (all detected and blocked)\n- Fraud prevented: ~£47,000\n- Customer reimbursement: £0 (all customers had zero liability)\n- Detection rate: 97.1%  \n**AML/KYC Metrics:**\n- Customers screened: 180\n- PEP matches: 2 (investigated, false positives)\n- SARs filed: 3 (all compliant with timeline)\n- High-risk accounts: 12 (under enhanced monitoring)  \n**Committee Assessment:**\n- Strong fraud prevention (97% detection rate)\n- Effective AML controls (proactive SAR filing)\n- No compliance violations detected  \n---",
